# The constants the Rust libc crate exports for x86_64-lean_os, named here and
# valued by this project's own C headers rather than typed twice.
# tools/rust-port/gen-libc-constants.py reads this; tools/rust-test.sh
# regenerates the output and fails a run in which it changed.
#
# Names already defined by the libc crate's generic unix module - DT_*,
# FD_CLOEXEC, S_ISUID, S_ISGID, S_ISVTX, SIG_DFL, SIG_IGN - are deliberately
# absent: a glob re-export cannot override them, so listing them would be a
# value nobody reads.

